    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You shape-shift as if you had used Wild Shape, without expending a use of it. Until the start of your next turn, any creature that starts its turn within 5 feet of you has Disadvantage on attack rolls against creatures other than you.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-mcNuuxoYzCHTswok\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Take the Wild Shape form with your Wild Shape feature; the effect marks the roar, whose Disadvantage is applied by hand.</p></section>",
